new_head "Keep"
new_text "I don't know if i have done something wrong, but...I had eq's one day, and I put them into keep.Then i got around making exp and finding myself someequipments that i do appreciate very high.That's why i got into shop.So, I was in the shop and sold some equipments when I realized that I have sold and eq i was having [in keep].This didn't piss me off, but I thought that maybe people whohave more valuable items with them and want tokeep them with themselves would not like whentheir equipments which are not free, as i recall,are lost in the shop.So, if there is a bug with the 'keep', you could fix it.i think that it is one of the most needed commands in MUD.All the best,PROGE"
